---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | Cover & Capital India"
  description="Cover & Capital India is a static, privacy-first educational publication. Zero tracking, zero third-party analytics, zero server-side storage of calculator inputs."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="space-y-8">
      <div class="border-b border-[#E5E3D8] pb-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#0D5C46]">Data Ethics</span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold font-serif text-[#0F172A] mt-2">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-[#475569] mt-3 leading-relaxed">
          Last reviewed: October 10, 2026. Cover & Capital India is built from the ground up to protect reader privacy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="editorial-prose space-y-6">
        <h2>1. Zero Personal Data Collection</h2>
        <p>
          We do not collect names, email addresses, phone numbers, Aadhaar numbers, PAN details, dates of birth, medical histories, or salary information. There is no user registration, no login system, and no backend database.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Local, In-Memory Financial Calculators</h2>
        <p>
          When you enter values into our Life Cover Estimator, Buy Term & Invest Difference calculator, or Guaranteed Policy Return analyzer:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>All calculations execute locally within your browser's JavaScript runtime engine.</li>
          <li>Your inputs are never transmitted to any server, third-party API, or cloud storage.</li>
          <li>Refreshing or closing the browser window completely erases all entered numbers.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Zero Third-Party Advertising & Tracking Scripts</h2>
        <p>
          Unlike commercial insurance aggregators and financial portals:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>We run <strong>no Google Analytics, Facebook Pixels, or behavioral advertising trackers</strong>.</li>
          <li>We do not set commercial cookies to profile your reading habits.</li>
          <li>We will never sell or share user data with insurance telemarketers, brokers, or banks.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Static Hosting Infrastructure</h2>
        <p>
          The website is hosted statically on GitHub Pages. GitHub may log basic HTTP transmission data (such as visitor IP address and user agent) for server security and denial-of-service prevention under their standard enterprise privacy statement.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
